# Diamond story 28-valor-lakefront-grunt-secretpotion: standalone start (--lab, or no end save from 27-pastoria-galactic-grunt-rival).
# Standard header + lab party + the cumulative state after 27-pastoria-galactic-grunt-rival, then the milestone's start.
# Applied on the D/P new-game base save (bedroom), so INIT_NEW_GAME state (scr_seq 0377) is present; RemoveEvent sets
# an object's hidden_flag (games/diamond/arm9/src/map_object.c:295-299). The starter var comes from the prior deltas.
name GQ
gender PLAYER_GENDER_MALE
trainer-id 31415
money 20000
# Lab party (slice convention): Surf in slot 0, slots 1-3 cleared so an empty Surf falls back to Struggle.
# Opponent: TRAINER_GALACTIC_GRUNT_36 (trdata.json #847: GLAMEOW 25), plus any Route 213 sight trainer on the beach
# (e.g. TUBER_F Chelsea #108 BIBAREL 23, TUBER_M Jared #107 SHELLOS 19/21/20).
party SPECIES_EMPOLEON 60 ITEM_NONE
party-move 0 0 MOVE_SURF
party-move 0 1 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_NONE
party-move 0 3 MOVE_NONE
party SPECIES_STARAPTOR 50 ITEM_NONE
party-move 1 0 MOVE_AERIAL_ACE
party-move 1 1 MOVE_ROCK_SMASH
party-move 1 2 MOVE_CUT
# @@PRIOR@@
# -- start --
map MAP_PASTORIA 636 812 FACE_RIGHT  # 27's end: west of the grunt's gate spot (637,812), the rival scene only turns the player (scr_seq 0118 Move_050C) [INFERENCE]
